    <div class="container">
        <div class="left-side">
		<h2>Seedance 2.0</h2>
			<p1>
				Seedance 2.0 is new AI video generation that was develop 
				by ByteDance, the company that created TikTok. The model 
				uses multiple sources of input to in order to create it’s 
				output including text prompts, images, video clips, and 
				audio. This is what makes Seedance 2.0 stand out. Previous 
				AI videos generators only used text prompts because Seedance 
				2.0 uses multiple prompts, the end results come out much better.
				 There are less noticeable errors when it comes to the physics 
				 because there is a more synchronization when it between the
				  multiple inputs than just a text prompt. For example the 
				  lip movements line up better in the final product when a 
				  character is speaking. When this was released earlier this 
				  year, the results looked like high budget Hollywood movies.
				   Seedance 2.0 allows users to act as if they are a director 
				   producing an actual film. This model is great for anyone looking
				    to make quick videos without using a full production team. 

			</p1>

		<h2>Popular Uses:</h2>
			<ul>
            	<li>Marketing</li>
         		<li>Film Making</li>
            	<li>Protyping Scenes</li>
            	<li>Rapid Creative Production</li>
        </ul> 

			


